Description: Limine boot loader integration for Soplos Linux
 Limine only reads FAT, so the kernels in /boot cannot be booted as they
 are. This package keeps a copy of every installed kernel and its initrd
 on the FAT partition Limine boots from, and writes limine.conf, whenever
 a kernel is installed or removed or dracut rebuilds an initrd.
 .
