 limine-update rewrites its menu: one entry per kernel with its recovery
 mode, and the other systems found on the disks. The kernel command line
 is read from /etc/kernel/cmdline and the settings from
 /etc/default/limine. Nothing is changed on the disk until limine-install
 is run.

