 symlinks to cache-12. The host fontconfig 2.17 then exposes WOFF/WOFF2
 fonts without family or charset, which win font matching and crash
 Qt applications in FcCharSetHasChar. Rejecting these web fonts avoids
 the crash. TTF/OTF versions of the same fonts are not affected.
 .
 A systemd user unit also removes the foreign cache-9 symlinks from the
 user font cache as soon as they appear and rebuilds the host cache. This
 protects Flatpak applications, which do not read the host fontconfig
 configuration, and restores Type1 fonts.

